        "original_id": "e38458ca-3b8f-5a96-9a19-a58c63c6f4fa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Laure Gardette, François Ozon, Eric Altmayer, Nicolas Altmayer\n- Films: Polisse, In the House, Young & Beautiful\n- Awards: César Award\n- Topics: Film editing, French drama films, adolescent sexuality\n\nFacts:\n- Laure Gardette edited the film Polisse and won a César Award for that work.\n- Laure Gardette also edited the films In the House and Young & Beautiful.\n- Young & Beautiful, titled Jeune & Jolie in French, is a 2013 French drama film about adolescent sexuality.\n- François Ozon directed Young & Beautiful.\n- Eric Altmayer and Nicolas Altmayer produced Young & Beautiful.",
